Here is the document for an Autark histogram of the buildings' heights. Add an Autark node, paste it in and connect the OpenStreetMap layers node to it:

```json
{
  "plot": {
    "dataRef": "table_osm_buildings",
    "mark": "bar",
    "axis": [
      "height",
      "@transform"
    ],
    "title": "Chicago Loop building heights",
    "transform": {
      "preset": "binning-1d",
      "options": {
        "bins": 12
      }
    },
    "events": [
      "brushX"
    ]
  }
}
```

